WEBVTT

00:09:57.733 --> 00:10:00.483
We have over 70,000 people.

00:10:00.483 --> 00:10:03.273
So it's how do you bring
the people together,

00:10:03.273 --> 00:10:06.903
make sure they are happy,
learn to work well together

00:10:06.903 --> 00:10:10.263
and they are aligned towards
making great things happen.

00:10:10.263 --> 00:10:15.363
Leadership at this level is much more
about managing and guiding people

00:10:15.363 --> 00:10:17.003
than anything else.

00:10:17.003 --> 00:10:20.753
Sundar says, "At this level,
it is about managing and guiding people."

00:10:20.753 --> 00:10:24.493
How to manage and guide people.

00:10:24.493 --> 00:10:27.633
So my next question 
stems from that, Sundar.

00:10:27.634 --> 00:10:30.804
You are a hands-on innovator,